{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-distributed-computing","title":"并行与分布式计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance/parallel-distributed-computing","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行与分布式计算\">并行与分布式计算</h1><p>Julia 从语言设计之初就将并行计算作为一等公民——不是事后加装的库，而是深度集成在运行时中。三种并行模型覆盖从笔记本到超算的全部场景：基于任务的多线程（共享内存）、多进程分布式计算（消息传递）、以及 GPU 内核并行（见<a href=\"gpu-computing-cuda\">GPU 计算与 CUDA.jl</a>）。Julia 的独特优势在于这三种模型共享同一语言和类型系统——并行代码与串行代码几乎同构，不需要像 MPI/OpenMP 那样学习完全不同的编程范式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Julia 的并行能力不是事后加装的库，而是深度集成在运行时中的语言特性，其独特之处在于<strong>三种并行模型共享同一语言和类型系统</strong>——多线程（共享内存，基于任务）、多进程（消息传递，<code>Distributed</code>）、GPU 内核并行，因此并行代码与串行代码几乎同构，不必像 MPI/OpenMP 那样学习完全不同的编程范式。三种模型背后是同一个权衡：并行收益 = 计算量 −（调度 + 同步 + 通信）开销，因此决定成败的从来不是「能并行多少线程」，而是任务粒度是否够粗、数据移动是否够少、负载是否够均衡。围绕这一主线有三组具体机制：调度策略（<code>@threads :static</code> 静态均分 vs <code>:dynamic</code> 工作窃取）、同步原语（<code>Atomic</code> 无锁 vs <code>SpinLock</code> 临界区，最佳实践是尽量不共享、用线程局部缓冲做归约）、以及共享数据的两种形态（同一物理机上的 <code>SharedArray</code> vs 跨节点的 <code>DistributedArrays</code>/MPI.jl）。在此之上，FLoops.jl 与 Dagger.jl 把执行后端与数据依赖进一步抽象出来。下文沿多线程、同步、分布式、共享数组、高级模式与调优实践逐层展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多线程并行\">多线程并行</h2><p>Julia 从 1.3 版本开始提供成熟的任务级多线程。通过 <code>julia --threads=auto</code> 启动时自动检测 CPU 核心数，<code>Threads.@threads</code> 和 <code>Threads.@spawn</code> 是两种主要的并行原语：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Base.Threads&#10;&#10;# 数据并行：@threads 自动分割循环迭代&#10;function parallel_sum(v::Vector{Float64})&#10;    partial = zeros(nthreads())&#10;    @threads for i in eachindex(v)&#10;        partial[threadid()] += v[i]&#10;    end&#10;    return sum(partial)&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 任务并行：@spawn 创建异步任务&#10;function parallel_map(f, items)&#10;    tasks = map(items) do item&#10;        @spawn f(item)&#10;    end&#10;    return fetch.(tasks)&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Base.Threads</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 数据并行：@threads 自动分割循环迭代</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function parallel_sum(v::Vector{Float64})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    partial = zeros(nthreads())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @threads for i in eachindex(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        partial[threadid()] += v[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return sum(partial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 任务并行：@spawn 创建异步任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function parallel_map(f, items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tasks = map(items) do item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        @spawn f(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return fetch.(tasks)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并行原语</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>调度方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@threads :static</code></td>\n<td>循环迭代</td>\n<td>静态均分</td>\n<td>负载均匀的数据并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@threads :dynamic</code></td>\n<td>循环迭代</td>\n<td>工作窃取</td>\n<td>负载不均匀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@spawn</code> / <code>@async</code></td>\n<td>任务</td>\n<td>协作式调度</td>\n<td>异步 I/O、不规则并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@simd</code></td>\n<td>向量指令</td>\n<td>编译器</td>\n<td>连续内存的数值循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Julia 1.11+ 的线程调度器采用<strong>工作窃取</strong>（work-stealing）策略——空闲线程从繁忙线程的任务队列尾部偷取任务，自动平衡负载。<code>@threads :dynamic</code>（Julia 1.11 默认）使得不均匀负载的循环也能高效并行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线程安全与同步\">线程安全与同步</h2><p>共享内存并行的核心挑战是数据竞争。Julia 提供了标准同步原语：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Base.Threads&#10;&#10;# 原子操作：无锁计数器&#10;counter = Atomic{Int}(0)&#10;@threads for i in 1:1_000_000&#10;    atomic_add!(counter, 1)&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 自旋锁：保护共享数据结构&#10;lock = SpinLock()&#10;shared_dict = Dict{Int, Float64}()&#10;@threads for i in 1:100&#10;    result = expensive_computation(i)&#10;    @lock lock shared_dict[i] = result&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 线程安全的通道&#10;ch = Channel{Float64}(100)&#10;@spawn begin&#10;    for i in 1:100&#10;        put!(ch, rand())&#10;    end&#10;    close(ch)&#10;end&#10;results = collect(ch)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Base.Threads</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 原子操作：无锁计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter = Atomic{Int}(0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@threads for i in 1:1_000_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    atomic_add!(counter, 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 自旋锁：保护共享数据结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock = SpinLock()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shared_dict = Dict{Int, Float64}()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@threads for i in 1:100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = expensive_computation(i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @lock lock shared_dict[i] = result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 线程安全的通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ch = Channel{Float64}(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@spawn begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 1:100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        put!(ch, rand())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    close(ch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results = collect(ch)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[主线程] --&gt; B[启动 N 个工作线程]&#10;    B --&gt; C[线程 1&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 1]&#10;    B --&gt; D[线程 2&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 2]&#10;    B --&gt; E[线程 N&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 N]&#10;    C --&gt; F{需要同步?}&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|原子操作| G[Atomic 累加]&#10;    F --&gt;|临界区| H[Lock 保护]&#10;    F --&gt;|无共享| I[线程局部结果]&#10;    G --&gt; J[归约合并]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[主线程收集最终结果]\">graph TD\n    A[主线程] --&gt; B[启动 N 个工作线程]\n    B --&gt; C[线程 1&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 1]\n    B --&gt; D[线程 2&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 2]\n    B --&gt; E[线程 N&lt;br/&gt;处理分片 N]\n    C --&gt; F{需要同步?}\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|原子操作| G[Atomic 累加]\n    F --&gt;|临界区| H[Lock 保护]\n    F --&gt;|无共享| I[线程局部结果]\n    G --&gt; J[归约合并]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[主线程收集最终结果]</pre><p>最佳实践是<strong>最小化共享</strong>：每个线程持有局部缓冲区，最终做一次归约——这避免了锁竞争和缓存行伪共享（false sharing）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式计算-distributed-jl\">分布式计算：Distributed.jl</h2><p>对于超出单机内存或需要多节点计算的场景，Julia 内置的 <code>Distributed</code> 标准库提供了进程级并行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Distributed&#10;&#10;# 添加 4 个本地工作进程&#10;addprocs(4)&#10;&#10;# @everywhere 在所有进程上执行&#10;@everywhere using LinearAlgebra&#10;&#10;# 分布式 map：自动负载分配&#10;results = pmap(1:100) do i&#10;    A = rand(500, 500)&#10;    eigvals(A)  # 每个进程独立计算&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 远程引用与 Future&#10;future = @spawnat 2 begin&#10;    A = rand(1000, 1000)&#10;    svd(A)&#10;end&#10;result = fetch(future)  # 阻塞等待结果\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Distributed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 添加 4 个本地工作进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>addprocs(4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># @everywhere 在所有进程上执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@everywhere using LinearAlgebra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 分布式 map：自动负载分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results = pmap(1:100) do i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    A = rand(500, 500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    eigvals(A)  # 每个进程独立计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 远程引用与 Future</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>future = @spawnat 2 begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    A = rand(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    svd(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result = fetch(future)  # 阻塞等待结果</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pmap</code> 是最常用的高级接口——自动将任务分配给可用工作进程，返回有序结果。对于粗粒度任务（每个任务 &gt;1ms），<code>pmap</code> 的调度开销可以忽略不计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享数组与分布式数组\">共享数组与分布式数组</h2><p>跨进程的数据共享有两种模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using SharedArrays, Distributed&#10;&#10;# SharedArray：多进程共享内存（仅限同一物理机）&#10;S = SharedArray{Float64}(1000, 1000)&#10;@distributed for j in 1:1000&#10;    for i in 1:1000&#10;        S[i, j] = sin(i * j * 0.001)&#10;    end&#10;end&#10;&#10;# DistributedArrays：跨节点分布存储&#10;using DistributedArrays&#10;D = dzeros(10000, 10000)  # 自动分布到所有工作进程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using SharedArrays, Distributed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># SharedArray：多进程共享内存（仅限同一物理机）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = SharedArray{Float64}(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@distributed for j in 1:1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 1:1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        S[i, j] = sin(i * j * 0.001)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># DistributedArrays：跨节点分布存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using DistributedArrays</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>D = dzeros(10000, 10000)  # 自动分布到所有工作进程</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于大规模科学计算（PDE 离散化、粒子模拟），MPI.jl 提供了对 MPI 标准的完整封装，性能与 C/Fortran MPI 程序等价：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using MPI&#10;&#10;MPI.Init()&#10;comm = MPI.COMM_WORLD&#10;rank = MPI.Comm_rank(comm)&#10;size = MPI.Comm_size(comm)&#10;&#10;# 每个进程计算局部结果&#10;local_sum = sum(rand(1_000_000))&#10;&#10;# 全局归约&#10;global_sum = MPI.Allreduce(local_sum, MPI.SUM, comm)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using MPI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MPI.Init()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>comm = MPI.COMM_WORLD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rank = MPI.Comm_rank(comm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>size = MPI.Comm_size(comm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 每个进程计算局部结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local_sum = sum(rand(1_000_000))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 全局归约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>global_sum = MPI.Allreduce(local_sum, MPI.SUM, comm)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"高级并行模式\">高级并行模式</h2><p><strong>FLoops.jl</strong>：为 <code>for</code> 循环提供统一的并行执行器接口——同一循环体可以在串行、多线程、分布式、GPU 之间切换执行后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using FLoops&#10;&#10;# 同一代码，不同执行器&#10;@floop ThreadedEx() for x in 1:1_000_000&#10;    @reduce(s += sin(x * 0.001))&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 切换为串行执行（调试用）&#10;@floop SequentialEx() for x in 1:1_000_000&#10;    @reduce(s += sin(x * 0.001))&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using FLoops</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 同一代码，不同执行器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@floop ThreadedEx() for x in 1:1_000_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @reduce(s += sin(x * 0.001))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 切换为串行执行（调试用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@floop SequentialEx() for x in 1:1_000_000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @reduce(s += sin(x * 0.001))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Dagger.jl</strong>：Julia 版的任务 DAG 调度器（类似 Dask），自动分析数据依赖并并行化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Dagger&#10;&#10;# 声明计算 DAG&#10;a = Dagger.@spawn rand(1000, 1000)&#10;b = Dagger.@spawn rand(1000, 1000)&#10;c = Dagger.@spawn a * b&#10;d = Dagger.@spawn svd(c)&#10;&#10;# 触发执行（自动并行无数据依赖的任务）&#10;result = fetch(d)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Dagger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 声明计算 DAG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>a = Dagger.@spawn rand(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>b = Dagger.@spawn rand(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>c = Dagger.@spawn a * b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d = Dagger.@spawn svd(c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 触发执行（自动并行无数据依赖的任务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result = fetch(d)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能调优实践\">性能调优实践</h2><p>并行程序的性能瓶颈通常不是计算本身，而是<strong>通信和同步开销</strong>。关键调优原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粗粒度任务</strong>：每个并行任务应包含足够计算量（&gt;1ms），否则调度开销会淹没并行收益</li>\n<li><strong>减少数据移动</strong>：分布式计算中数据传输比计算贵 100-1000 倍——将计算移向数据</li>\n<li><strong>避免伪共享</strong>：多线程访问同一缓存行的不同元素会导致缓存行乒乓——按缓存行大小（64 字节）对齐数据分片</li>\n<li><strong>负载均衡</strong>：使用 <code>@threads :dynamic</code> 或 <code>pmap</code> 的动态调度而非静态均分</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些并行策略可以与<a href=\"../foundations/performance-model-optimization\">性能模型与优化</a>中的单线程优化技巧叠加——先确保单核性能最优，再引入并行扩展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三种模型共享同一语言</strong>：多线程（<code>@threads</code>/<code>@spawn</code>，共享内存）、多进程（<code>Distributed</code>，消息传递）、GPU 内核并行，并行代码与串行代码近乎同构。</li>\n<li><strong>调度策略决定负载均衡</strong>：<code>:static</code> 适合均匀负载，<code>:dynamic</code>（Julia 1.11 默认）用工作窃取处理不均匀负载。</li>\n<li><strong>同步开销是主要敌人</strong>：<code>Atomic</code> 无锁计数器、<code>SpinLock</code> 保护临界区、<code>Channel</code> 传递消息，但最佳实践是最小化共享——线程局部缓冲 + 一次归约。</li>\n<li><strong>分布式计算按粒度选择接口</strong>：<code>pmap</code> 自动分配粗粒度任务（&gt;1ms），<code>@spawnat</code> + <code>fetch</code> 处理远程引用；MPI.jl 提供与 C/Fortran 等价的性能。</li>\n<li><strong>共享数据分两种形态</strong>：<code>SharedArray</code> 限同一物理机，<code>DistributedArrays</code>/MPI.jl 跨节点分布。</li>\n<li><strong>调优的四条铁律</strong>：粗粒度任务（&gt;1ms）、减少数据移动（传输比计算贵 100–1000 倍）、避免伪共享（按 64 字节缓存行对齐）、负载均衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行与分布式计算","id":"并行与分布式计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多线程并行","id":"多线程并行"},{"level":2,"text":"线程安全与同步","id":"线程安全与同步"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式计算：Distributed.jl","id":"分布式计算-distributed-jl"},{"level":2,"text":"共享数组与分布式数组","id":"共享数组与分布式数组"},{"level":2,"text":"高级并行模式","id":"高级并行模式"},{"level":2,"text":"性能调优实践","id":"性能调优实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可视化与绘图生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/data-visualization/plotting-ecosystem"},"next":{"title":"GPU 计算与 CUDA.jl","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/high-performance/gpu-computing-cuda"}}